message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "Open-Source Game Theory, mechanized"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 mechanization of proof-based open-source game theory (the engine, and PA-S', Peano
  Arithmetic with a provability predicate bounded by proof length), its extension to partial
  transparency, and the evolutionary analysis of the resulting populations.
